         calm and non-judgmental — no urgency, scarcity, or guilt. -->
    <string-array name="pause_phrases">
        <item>This moment is the only one there is.</item>
        <item>Attention is how we spend our days.</item>
        <item>Focus is a quiet kind of freedom.</item>
        <item>Time given with intention is time well kept.</item>
        <item>There is beauty in a single, unhurried breath.</item>
        <item>Where your attention goes, your life follows.</item>
